flowchart TB
    A[Symptom\nWhat went wrong?] --> B[Reproduce\nExact command or input]
    B --> C[Locate layer\nInstall, env, flow, model, API, app]
    C --> D[Test smallest part\nOne component or one request]
    D --> E[Fix root cause\nDo not hide errors]
    E --> F[Verify\nSame command now passes]
    F --> G[Document\nAdd note to README or CLAUDE.md]

    classDef item fill:#FFFFFF,stroke:#475467,stroke-width:2px,color:#101828;
    class A,B,C,D,E,F,G item;
